          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The \"Professional Baseball Spirits\" series is a professional baseball game that pursues realism.\n\nThe first home game, \"Professional Baseball Spirits 2004,'' was released on March 25, 2004. \"Professional Baseball Spirits 2015\" introduces 3D scanning technology that photographs professional baseball players from 360 degrees and reproduces them three-dimensionally.\n\nFurthermore, we have also adopted laser scanning technology that measures the precise shape of the stadium, allowing you to enjoy a realistic baseball experience with overwhelming expressiveness.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La serie «Professional Baseball Spirits» es un juego de béisbol profesional que busca el realismo.\n\nEl primer juego de la serie, «Professional Baseball Spirits 2004», salió a la venta el 25 de marzo de 2004. «Professional Baseball Spirits 2015» introduce la tecnología de escaneo 3D, que fotografía a los jugadores de béisbol profesional desde 360 grados y los reproduce en tres dimensiones.\n\nAdemás, se ha adoptado la tecnología de escaneo láser, que mide la forma precisa del estadio, lo que permite disfrutar de una experiencia de béisbol realista y de gran expresividad.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2024",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
